Integration by YeFeng233: native-only subset without Python or WASM bindings;
the immutable agari lookup table uses std::collections::HashMap instead of
BoomHashMap, preserving the keys, values and lookup results. Sanma model
compatibility is checked against Akagi's pinned 775-channel reference.
Tile.next uses sanma's 1m/9m dora cycle. Tile.prev intentionally retains the
old reference's uradora-estimation behavior. Two upstream yonma EV fixtures
remain ignored because their hardcoded values assume four-player payments.
No model weights are included. Upstream authors do not endorse this application.
